  "notes": "{電話|でんわ}する is a suru-verb meaning to make a phone call or contact someone by telephone.\n\nPARTICLE USAGE:\n- 〜に{電話|でんわ}する: to call someone (person marked with に)\n- 〜へ{電話|でんわ}する: to call a place\n\nALTERNATIVE EXPRESSIONS:\n- {電話|でんわ}をかける: to make a call (slightly more formal)\n- {電話|でんわ}を{入|い}れる: to make a call (casual)\n\nRELATED EXPRESSIONS:\n- {電話|でんわ}に{出|で}る: to answer the phone\n- {電話|でんわ}を{切|き}る: to hang up\n- {電話|でんわ}が{鳴|な}る: the phone rings\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {電話番号|でんわばんごう}: phone number\n- {携帯|けいたい}({電話|でんわ}): mobile phone\n- {固定|こてい}{電話|でんわ}: landline",
